lass="C-ESTILO-1--Texto-ebe5c544 C-ESTILO-1--Texto"> se presenta, única y exclusivamente, a efectos comparativos.</span></p><p class="ESTILO-1--Texto-b2de45cc" style="font-size: 9pt; margin-bottom: 0;"><span class="C-ESTILO-1--Texto-ebe5c544 C-ESTILO-1--Texto">Las Notas descritas en la Memoria forman parte integrante del Estado de flujos de efectivo correspondiente al ejercicio anual terminado el 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_25/frag:b8a61d216a354370ba8c3bfec651bcdd/textregion:b8a61d216a354370ba8c3bfec651bcdd_517"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-ESTILO-1--Texto-ebe5c544 C-ESTILO-1--Texto">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_25/frag:b8a61d216a354370ba8c3bfec651bcdd/textregion:b8a61d216a354370ba8c3bfec651bcdd_517"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-ESTILO-1--Texto-ebe5c544 C-ESTILO-1--Texto">.</span></p></div></div><wk:footer><div style="bottom: 19.84pt; height: 70.87pt; left: 85.04pt; position: absolute; width: 439.44pt;"><div style="bottom: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; width: 439.44pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_25/frag:64fd503d5ae7450cb8d1946a7397a761/tab