<wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/table:0043de0bef444e5c99a3fa76bff5282c/tablerange:0043de0bef444e5c99a3fa76bff5282c_11-3-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></div></td><td class="cellStyle-3780e2db" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div style="height: 12pt; overflow: hidden;"><p class="TableGrid-nivel-1-2a634c4d" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/table:0043de0bef444e5c99a3fa76bff5282c/tablerange:0043de0bef444e5c99a3fa76bff5282c_11-4-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="1" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="133" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="true" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-TableGrid-nivel-1">133</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/table:0043de0bef444e5c99a3fa76bff5282c/tablerange:0043de0bef444e5c99a3fa76bff5282c_11-4-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/table:0043de0bef444e5c99a3fa76bff5282c"></wk:table-end></div><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">En los ejercicios </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_173"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_173"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_178"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_178"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">, los gastos del personal propio que ha trabajado en proyectos de sistemas informáticos, incluidos como mayor coste de dichos proyectos, ascienden a </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_329"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="10" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">10</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_329"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_334"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="7" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">7</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_334"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, respectivamente.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">A 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_394"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_394"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_399"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_399"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> no existen activos intangibles en garantía de préstamos bancarios.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">A 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_490"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_490"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_495"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_495"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> </span><span class="C-Bodytext">no existen importes de inmovilizado intangible adquirido a empresas del grupo y asociadas. Asimismo, durante el ejercicio </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_620"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_620"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> se han enajenado elementos de inmovilizado intangible a empresas del grupo por importe de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_713"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="1" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="3" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="true" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">3</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_713"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros (ningún importe durante el ejercicio </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_771"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_771"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">).</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">IBERDROLA no posee elementos de inmovilizado inmaterial cuyos derechos pudieran ejercitarse fuera del territorio español en los ejercicios </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_915"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_915"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_920"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_920"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">.</span></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 0;"><span class="C-Bodytext">A 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_945"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_945"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_950"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_950"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> el importe de los activos intangibles en explotación totalmente amortizados asciende a </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_97/frag:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707/textregion:aa670da3b66a4ad09a4853b3f92b3707_1040"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="242" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" s