"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Header-Text-cde29221 C-Header-Text">5.031</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/table:561c582ab0d54ecaad98b6a1c32082e9/tablerange:561c582ab0d54ecaad98b6a1c32082e9_6-8-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 12.75pt;"><td class="cellStyle-b972c914" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="9"><p class="Header-Text-7c1c97df" style="font-size: 8pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-Text-95a92316 C-Header-Text">(1)</span><span class="C-Header-Text-3fb98b1d C-Header-Text"> Incluye derivados con terceros y con empresas del grupo y asociadas.</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/table:561c582ab0d54ecaad98b6a1c32082e9"></wk:table-end></div><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 0;"><span class="C-Bodytext">El valor razonable de los epígrafes “Deudas con entidades de crédito”, “Acreedores por arrendamientos financieros” y “Deudas con empresas del grupo y asociadas” (excepto instrumentos financieros derivados con empresas del grupo y asociadas) del pasivo corriente y no corriente del Balance a 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_724"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_724"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_729"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_729"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> asciende a </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_743"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="14448" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">14.448</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_743"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_748"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="14995" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">14.995</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_748"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, siendo el valor en libros de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_799"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="14499" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">14.499</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_799"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_804"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="15331" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">15.331</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/textregion:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de_804"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, respectivamente. Dicha valoración pertenece al Nivel 2 de jerarquía de valoración. El valor razonable del resto de los instrumentos financieros no difiere significativamente de su valor en libros. </span></p></div></div><wk:footer><div style="bottom: 35pt; height: 70.87pt; left: 85.05pt; position: absolute; width: 439.08pt;"><div style="bottom: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; width: 439.08pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:64fd503d5ae7450cb8d1946a7397a761/table:c8b7b55d5f71434086cd7e5b3b63b2bb"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-top: 2pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 438.75pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 309.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 129pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.75pt;"><td class="cellStyle-752ffde2" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td class="cellStyle-21e3bbc6" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div style="height: 24.75pt; overflow: hidden;"><p class="Table-Normal-3d41da26" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: relative; top: -2.4pt;"><span class="image-2ef6a85a7384a6a81ea46165be8e0060d1a812b5b92e6320915b0d070cb41e7e" style="height: 24.56pt; position: relative; top: -0.40499999999999936pt; width: 70.87pt;"></span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:64fd503d5ae7450cb8d1946a7397a761/table:c8b7b55d5f71434086cd7e5b3b63b2bb"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:footer></div><wk:page-break></wk:page-break><div class="pageView" style="min-height: 686pt; padding: 85pt 70pt 70pt 85pt; width: 439pt;"><wk:header><div style="height: 85.05pt; left: 56.69pt; position: absolute; top: 18.51pt; width: 509.68999999999994pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; top: 0; width: 509.68999999999994pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; padding-right: 18pt;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:b483030dc023478085eb76e3a9ea6f4b/table:641afed77d0444e083eab6082ff7d49d"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-top: 2pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 471pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 240pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 203.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 27.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 41.25pt;"><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-c4234790" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header">Informe financiero anual </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_25/frag:b483030dc023478085eb76e3a9ea6f4b/table:641afed77d0444e083eab6082ff7d49d/tablerange:641afed77d0444e083eab6082ff7d49d_0-0-1-1-826894/textregion:b5f01ce7a62145a3b099fac5eeccee49_29"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Header">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_25/frag:b483030dc023478085eb76e3a9ea6f4b/table:641afed77d0444e083eab6082ff7d49d/tablerange:641afed77d0444e083eab6082ff7d49d_0-0-1-1-826894/textregion:b5f01ce7a62145a3b099fac5eeccee49_29"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-Text" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-Text">Iberdrola, S.A.</span></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-page-number" style="font-size: 8.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-page-number">| </span><span class="C-Header-page-number">35</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:b483030dc023478085eb76e3a9ea6f4b/table:641afed77d0444e083eab6082ff7d49d"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:header><div><div style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; vertical-align: top; width: 100%;"><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Bodytext">El valor razonable se ha determinado mediante el descuento de los flujos de efectivo de los pagos futuros descontados mediante la utilización de tasas de mercado aplicables a la fecha de valoración.</span></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">IBERDROLA contabiliza los instrumentos financieros derivados por su valor razonable siempre que pueda ser medido de manera fiable y los clasifica en tres niveles: </span></p><p class="Bodytext-6ef513db" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Nivel 1: activos y pasivos cotizados en mercados líquidos.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-a00eb614" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Nivel 2: activos y pasivos cuyo valor razonable se ha determinado mediante técnicas de valoración que utilizan hipótesis observables en el mercado.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-a00eb614" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Nivel 3: activos y pasivos cuyo valor razonable se ha determinado mediante técnicas de valoración que no utilizan hipótesis observables en el mercado.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">El detalle del nivel al que pertenecen los instrumentos financieros derivados contabilizados a su valor razonable, expresado en millones de euros, es el siguiente:</span></p><div style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-top: 8pt;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/table:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 467.25pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 206.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 65.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 65.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 65.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 65.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.25pt;"><td class="cellStyle-d9125af3" style="padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-01828778" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Table-Normal-d0b3ba93 C-Table-Normal">sin dato</span></p></td><td class="cellStyle-7785677d" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-01828778" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/table:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849/tablerange:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849_0-1-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="dd.mm.yyyy" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="45657" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="3" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Table-Normal-9767c61a C-Table-Normal">31.12.2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/table:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849/tablerange:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849_0-1-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-7785677d" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-01828778" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/table:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849/tablerange:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849_0-2-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="d/m/yyyy" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="Nivel 1" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="3" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Table-Normal-9767c61a C-Table-Normal">Nivel 1</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/table:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849/tablerange:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849_0-2-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-7785677d" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-01828778" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_103/frag:d50024fd8a7645e5ada26949b90eb8de/table:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849/tablerange:399447671f4d4b0f87dc32e59daac849_0-3-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="d/m/yyyy" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="Nivel 2" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="3" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Table-Normal-9767c61a C-Table-Normal">Nivel 2</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f1