pan></p><p class="Bodytext-ac881e8c" style="font-size: 12pt; margin-bottom: 0;"><span><br /></span></p></div></div><wk:footer><div style="bottom: 35pt; height: 70.87pt; left: 70.87pt; position: absolute; width: 453.61pt;"><div style="bottom: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; width: 453.61pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:d46f8af84d1747b78dd847ffde2bf49d/table:3a0964ad377749c5a7c8c21adb49a251"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-top: 2pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 438pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 219pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 219pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.75pt;"><td class="cellStyle-752ffde2" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td class="cellStyle-21e3bbc6" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div style="height: 24.75pt; overflow: hidden;"><p class="Table-Normal-3d41da26" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: relative; top: -2.4pt;"><span class="image-2ef6a85a7384a6a81ea46165be8e0060d1a812b5b92e6320915b0d070cb41e7e" style="height: 24.56pt; position: relative; top: -0.40499999999999936pt; width: 70.87pt;"></span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:d46f8af84d1747b78dd847ffde2bf49d/table:3a0964ad377749c5a7c8c21adb49a251"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:footer></div><wk:page-break></wk:page-break><div class="pageView" style="min-height: 686pt; padding: 85pt 70pt 70pt 70pt; width: 453pt;"><wk:header><div style="height: 85.05pt; left: 63.78pt; position: absolute; top: 32.19pt; width: 503.22pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; top: 0; width: 503.22pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:b2d2b934f1e84cd5a8134d3138dffe4f/table:2dd49fb5e79b447fbbe6ad1f14a43e73"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-top: 2pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 462pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 185.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 246pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 30.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.25pt;"><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-326307ad" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header">Informe financiero anual </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_127/frag:b2d2b934f1e84cd5a8134d3138dffe4f/table:2dd49fb5e79b447fbbe6ad1f14a43e73/tablerange:2dd49fb5e79b447fbbe6ad1f14a43e73_0-0-1-1-826894/textregion:2204661075e84f36bc1f70bbb2bdd553_29"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Header">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_127/frag:b2d2b934f1e84cd5a8134d3138dffe4f/table:2dd49fb5e79b447fbbe6ad1f14a43e73/tablerange:2dd49fb5e79b447fbbe6ad1f14a43e73_0-0-1-1-826894/textregion:2204661075e84f36bc1f70bbb2bdd553_29"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-Text" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-Text">Iberdrola, S.A.</span></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-page-number" style="font-size: 8.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-page-number">| </span><span class="C-Header-page-number">55</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:b2d2b934f1e84cd5a8134d3138dffe4f/table:2dd49fb5e79b447fbbe6ad1f14a43e73"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:header><div><div style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; vertical-align: top; width: 100%;"><p class="Normal-green-titles" style="font-size: 12pt; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Normal-green-titles">b) Planes de aportación definida</span></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">El personal en activo en plantilla de IBERDROLA y el personal jubilado con posterioridad al 9 de octubre de 1996, partícipes del plan de pensiones con promotores conjuntos de IBERDROLA, se encuentran acogidos a un sistema de pensiones de modalidad de empleo, de aportación definida e independiente de la Seguridad Social, para la contingencia de jubilación.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-5cb53306" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">La aportación periódica a realizar de acuerdo con dicho sistema y con el vigente Convenio Colectivo de IBERDROLA se calcula como un porcentaje del salario pensionable anual de cada trabajador, salvo para los incorporados después del 9 de octubre de 1996, en cuyo caso la relación contributiva a partir del 1 de enero de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_3533"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_3533"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> es del&#xa0; 75% a cargo de la empresa y del 25% a cargo del trabajador (a partir del 1 de enero de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_3631"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_3631"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> fue del 72,5% a cargo de la empresa y del 27,5% a cargo del trabajador), y para los incorporados con posterioridad al 20 de julio de 2015, en los que la empresa aporta 1/3 de la contribución total, siempre y cuando el trabajador aporte los 2/3 restantes, hasta la fecha en la que entre a formar parte del Salario Base de Calificación (SBC) momento en que se les aplicará el mismo criterio que a los incorporados con posterioridad al 9 de octubre de 1996. La Sociedad financia estas aportaciones para todos sus empleados en activo.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">Las aportaciones realizadas por IBERDROLA en los ejercicios </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4225"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4225"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4230"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4230"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> han ascendido a </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4249"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="4" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">4</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4249"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4254"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="3" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">3</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4254"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, respectivamente, y figuran registradas en el epígrafe “Gastos de personal” de la Cuenta de pérdidas y ganancias (Nota </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4394"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="18.2" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">18.2</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4394"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">).</span></p><p class="Normal-green-titles" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span class="C-Normal-green-titles">c) Planes de reestructuración</span></p><p class="Bodytext-b51b868e" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">IBERDROLA, tras el interés mostrado por algunos trabajadores en solicitar el régimen de prejubilación, ha ofrecido a dichos trabajadores la extinción por mutuo acuerdo de la relación laboral que los vinculaba, realizando un proceso de contratos individuales de desvinculación. </span></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">Las provisiones existentes por dicho concepto a 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4774"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4774"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4779"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/textregion:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb_4779"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">, expresadas en millones de euros, </span><span class="C-Bodytext">corresponden a los siguientes planes de reestructuración:</span></p><div style="margin-bottom: 15pt; margin-top: 8pt;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_151/frag:24182ea1895346ab997446e090f543bb/table:a08476e1a08447d398fd38867d16d223"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 453pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 153pt;" rowspan="1" colspan=