2195b3c" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 0.5pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-3d41da26-Percent" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_166/frag:115bd3c8348643119350a68b3a1f0e07/table:a1f3e29813e94bb6a4da9f30db115cfb/tablerange:a1f3e29813e94bb6a4da9f30db115cfb_4-2-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="1" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="true" precision="1" prefix="" raw-value="0.970063095717546" scale="-2" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="5" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="true" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Table-Normal">97,0 %</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_166/frag:115bd3c8348643119350a68b3a1f0e07/table:a1f3e29813e94bb6a4da9f30db115cfb/tablerange:a1f3e29813e94bb6a4da9f30db115cfb_4-2-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_166/frag:115bd3c8348643119350a68b3a1f0e07/table:a1f3e29813e94bb6a4da9f30db115cfb"></wk:table-end></div><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">La información incluida en las tablas anteriores se ha elaborado de conformidad con la Ley 15/2010, de 5 de julio, de modificación de la Ley 3/2004, de 29 de diciembre, por la que se establecen medidas de lucha contra la morosidad en las operaciones comerciales, la Ley 18/2022, de 28 de septiembre, de creación y crecimiento de empresas, y de acuerdo con la Resolución de 29 de enero de 2016, del Instituto de Contabilidad y Auditoría de Cuentas, sobre la información a incorporar en la Memoria de las Cuentas anuales en relación con los aplazamientos de pago a proveedores en operaciones comerciales. </span></p><p class="Bodytext-32f93c01" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span><br /></span></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 0;"><span><br /></span></p></div></div><wk:footer><div style="bottom: 27.78pt; height: 70.87pt; left: 77.95pt; position: absolute; width: 474.53pt;"><div style="bottom: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; width: 474.53pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_166/frag:ca33e0a901a54e42a2c8f315592d08ec/table:4bbeb99c70c146a2ae9cd28cd00baf35"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-top: 2pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 438.75pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 309.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 129pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.75pt;"><td class="cellStyle-752ffde2" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td class="cellStyle-21e3bbc6" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div style="height: 24.75pt; overflow: hidden;"><p class="Table-Normal-3d41da26" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: relative; top: -2.4pt;"><span class="image-2ef6a85a7384a6a81ea46165be8e0060d1a812b5b92e6320915b0d070cb41e7e" style="height: 24.56pt; position: relative; top: -0.40499999999999936pt; width: 70.87pt;"></span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_166/frag:ca33e0a901a54e42a2c8f315592d08ec/table:4bbeb99c70c146a2ae9cd28cd00baf35"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:footer></div><wk:page-break></wk:page-break><div class="pageView" style="min-height: 686pt; padding: 85pt 70pt 70pt 70pt; width: 453pt;"><wk:header><div style="height: 85.05pt; left: 63.77pt; position: absolute; top: 18.51pt; width: 488.43pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; top: 0; width: 488.43pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-top: 0; padding-right: 18pt;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_166/frag:9dba79bdd91243d1a86de233029106e3/table:332d1039395241999469f45f55f3f602"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; margin-top: 2pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 459.75pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 185.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 242.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 32.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 39.75pt;"><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-326307ad" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header">Informe financiero anual </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_160/frag:9dba79bdd91243d1a86de233029106e3/table:332d1039395241999469f45f55f3f602/tablerange:332d1039395241999469f45f55f3f602_0-0-1-1-826894/textregion:654d90793c6440558307571119b02fa8_29"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Header">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_160/frag:9dba79bdd91243d1a86de233029106e3/table:332d1039395241999469f45f55f3f602/tablerange:332d1039395241999469f45f55f3f602_0-0-1-1-826894/textregion:654d90793c6440558307571119b02fa8_29"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-Text" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-Text">Iberdrola, S.A.</span></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-page-number" style="font-size: 8.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-page-number">| </span><span class="C-Header-page-number">63</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_166/frag:9dba79bdd91243d1a86de233029106e3/table:332d1039395241999469f45f55f3f602"></wk:table-end></div><p class="Bodytext-3af96eee" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 0;"><span><br /></span></p></div></div></wk:header><div><div style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; vertical-align: top; width: 100%;"><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Bodytext">Las especificaciones con las que se ha elaborado dicha información son las siguientes:</span></p><p class="Bodytext-6ef513db" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Ratio de operaciones pagadas: importe en días resultante del cociente entre el sumatorio de los productos del importe de cada una de las operaciones pagadas por el número de días de pago y el importe total de los pagos realizados en el ejercicio.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-a00eb614" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Ratio de operaciones pendientes de pago: importe en días resultante del cociente entre el sumatorio de los productos del importe de cada una de las operaciones pendientes de pago por el número de días pendientes de pago y el importe total de los pagos pendientes.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-a00eb614" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Proveedores: acreedores comerciales incluidos en el pasivo corriente del Balance por deudas con suministradores de bienes o servicios.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-a00eb614" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Quedan fuera del ámbito de información los proveedores de inmovilizado y los acreedores por arrendamiento financiero. </span></p><p class="Bodytext-a00eb614" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Quedan fuera del ámbito de información las partidas correspondientes a tasas, cánones, indemnizaciones, etc., por no ser transacciones comerciales.</span></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span><br /></span></p><wk:section-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_166"></wk:section-end><wk:section-start hidden-section="false" name="17.	Situación fiscal" wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_169"></wk:section-start><div id="ib50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_169102" style="position: absolute; top: 0pt;"></div><p class="Heading-1" style="font-size: 17pt;"><span id="i557a6fbebed147878775152d1f51efaf"></span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_169/frag:b96f756740a64427bc57ac4431d16358/textregion:b96f756740a64427bc57ac4431d16358_5"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="17. Situación fiscal" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="0" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Heading-1">17. Situación fiscal</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_169/frag:b96f756740a64427bc57ac4431d16358/textregion:b96f756740a64427bc57ac4431d16358_5"></wk:observed-region-end></p><wk:section-start hidden-section="false" name="17.1 Administraciones Públicas" wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172"></wk:section-start><div id="ib50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172102" style="position: absolute; top: 0pt;"></div><p class="Heading-2" style="font-size: 14pt;"><span id="i4f1fee4de3114deeab186c599f16e13d"></span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/textregion:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75_5"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="17.1. Administraciones públicas" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="0" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Heading-2">17.1. Administraciones públicas</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/textregion:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75_5"></wk:observed-region-end></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">La composición de las cuentas de Administraciones Públicas del activo y del pasivo del Balance, a 31 de diciembre de los ejercicios </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/textregion:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75_140"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/textregion:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75_140"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/textregion:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75_145"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/textregion:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75_145"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">, expresada en millones de euros, es la siguiente:</span></p><div style="margin-bottom: 6pt; margin-top: 8pt;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/table:9ec871705c8a4857bd8dd19463571e8b"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 437.25pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 276.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 80.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 80.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 14.25pt;"><td class="cellStyle-d9963a49" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-01828778" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Table-Normal-d0b3ba93 C-Table-Normal">sin dato</span></p></td><td class="cellStyle-d9963a49" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-01828778" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/table:9ec871705c8a4857bd8dd19463571e8b/tablerange:9ec871705c8a4857bd8dd19463571e8b_0-1-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Table-Normal-9767c61a C-Table-Normal">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/table:9ec871705c8a4857bd8dd19463571e8b/tablerange:9ec871705c8a4857bd8dd19463571e8b_0-1-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-d9963a49" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-01828778" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_172/frag:78afccfca770483baf637b6ae4f67a75/table:9ec871705c8a4857bd8dd19463571e8b/tablerange:9ec871705c8a4857bd8dd19463571e8b_0-2-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" fo