se-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Table-Normal-d27ff4c1 C-Table-Normal">24,81 %</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_178/frag:17b86282f3034cc486cd6228fc20f3ea/table:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d/tablerange:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d_14-2-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 11.25pt;"><td class="cellStyle-35ef7cc8" rowspan="1" colspan="3"></td></tr><tr style="height: 24pt;"><td class="cellStyle-98c34e3c" style="padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="3"><p class="Header-Text-7c1c97df" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_178/frag:17b86282f3034cc486cd6228fc20f3ea/table:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d/tablerange:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d_16-0-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="(d) En el ejercicio 2023 se corresponde, principalmente, con la reestimación del efecto fiscal de determinadas transacciones intragrupo que no tienen impacto en el Grupo Consolidado. ." scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="0" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Header-Text-da3c030c C-Header-Text">(d) En el ejercicio 2023 se corresponde, principalmente, con la reestimación del efecto fiscal de determinadas transacciones intragrupo que no tienen impacto en el Grupo Consolidado. .</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_178/frag:17b86282f3034cc486cd6228fc20f3ea/table:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d/tablerange:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d_16-0-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td></tr><tr style="height: 24pt;"><td class="cellStyle-98c34e3c" style="padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="3"><p class="Header-Text-7c1c97df" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_178/frag:17b86282f3034cc486cd6228fc20f3ea/table:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d/tablerange:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d_17-0-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="(e) En los ejercicios 2024 y 2023 se corresponde, principalmente, con el Impuesto sobre Beneficios soportado en el extranjero." scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="0" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Header-Text-da3c030c C-Header-Text">(e) En los ejercicios 2024 y 2023 se corresponde, principalmente, con el Impuesto sobre Beneficios soportado en el extranjero.</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_178/frag:17b86282f3034cc486cd6228fc20f3ea/table:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d/tablerange:78d26cbc16f245e5b5c65a18a18cf00d_17-0-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec