-Normal-d27ff4c1 C-Table-Normal">1.699</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/table:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046/tablerange:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046_180-2-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-e91aea7b" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-3d41da26" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/table:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046/tablerange:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046_180-3-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="1" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="129" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="true" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Table-Normal-d27ff4c1 C-Table-Normal">129</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/table:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046/tablerange:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046_180-3-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-e91aea7b" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-3d41da26" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/table:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046/tablerange:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046_180-4-1-1-826894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="1" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="4668" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="true" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Table-Normal-d27ff4c1 C-Table-Normal">4.668</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/table:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046/tablerange:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046_180-4-1-1-826894"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/table:d4abc9f3cf8a488493c4be1b0b875046"></wk:table-end></div><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">La Sociedad dispone de un contrato de cuenta corriente con Iberdrola Financiación, S.A.U. que tiene una duración de un año renovable automáticamente por sucesivos períodos de igual duración, salvo renuncia por alguna de las partes y está denominado en euros. A 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/textregion:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f_1152"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/textregion:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f_1152"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> el saldo acreedor asciende a 968 millones de euros (saldo acreedor de 3.629 millones de euros a 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/textregion:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f_1270"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/textregion:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f_1270"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">). </span></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-bottom: 0;"><span><br /></span></p></div></div><wk:footer><div style="bottom: 35pt; height: 70.87pt; left: 70.87pt; position: absolute; width: 453.26pt;"><div style="bottom: 0; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; width: 453.26pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:02c1687fc594410ab52fdbfc41627ee4/table:de766cff13f64d0b9b596ffa19f040de"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-top: 2pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 438.75pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 292.5pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 146.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 24.75pt;"><td class="cellStyle-752ffde2" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td class="cellStyle-21e3bbc6" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div style="height: 24.75pt; overflow: hidden;"><p class="Table-Normal-3d41da26" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: relative; top: -2.4pt;"><span class="image-2ef6a85a7384a6a81ea46165be8e0060d1a812b5b92e6320915b0d070cb41e7e" style="height: 24.56pt; position: relative; top: -0.40499999999999936pt; width: 70.87pt;"></span></p></div></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:02c1687fc594410ab52fdbfc41627ee4/table:de766cff13f64d0b9b596ffa19f040de"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:footer></div><wk:page-break></wk:page-break><div class="pageView" style="min-height: 686pt; padding: 85pt 70pt 70pt 70pt; width: 453pt;"><wk:header><div style="height: 85.05pt; left: 70.87pt; position: absolute; top: 40.17pt; width: 453.26pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; position: absolute; top: 0; width: 453.26pt;"><div style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:b3e1c0008de44fee93ffdc3387cd6ca7/table:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; margin-bottom: 2pt; margin-top: 2pt; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 438.75pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 246.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 166.5pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 25.5pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 39.75pt;"><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header" style="font-size: 10pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header">Informe financiero anual </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_244/frag:b3e1c0008de44fee93ffdc3387cd6ca7/table:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c/tablerange:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c_0-0-1-1-826894/textregion:9034f9057ab44fb584495182af74a4d3_29"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Header">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_244/frag:b3e1c0008de44fee93ffdc3387cd6ca7/table:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c/tablerange:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c_0-0-1-1-826894/textregion:9034f9057ab44fb584495182af74a4d3_29"></wk:observed-region-end></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-Text" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-Text">Iberdrola, S.A.</span></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-page-number" style="font-size: 8.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-page-number">| </span><span class="C-Header-page-number">91</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:b3e1c0008de44fee93ffdc3387cd6ca7/table:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:header><div><div style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; vertical-align: top; width: 100%;"><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Bodytext">La correspondiente liquidación de intereses se realiza anualmente y los tipos de interés aplicables para cada trimestre son los siguientes:</span></p><p class="Bodytext-6f1af39c" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">EURIBOR a 3 meses más 23,58 puntos básicos para los saldos deudores.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-d407db84" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">EURIBOR a 3 meses más 23,58 puntos básicos para los saldos acreedores.</span></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">El saldo acreedor a corto plazo con Iberdrola Financiación, S.A.U. a 31 de diciembre de 2024 se ha reducido respecto al ejercicio anterior debido a la formalización de operaciones de financiación a largo plazo y a las menores necesidades de financiación de la Sociedad.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">Los vencimientos y el desglose por monedas de los saldos acreedores a 31 de diciembre de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/textregion:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f_1916"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/textregion:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f_1916"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/textregion:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f_1921"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/textregion:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f_1921"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">, expresados en millones de euros,</span><span class="C-Bodytext"> son los siguientes:</span></p><div style="margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-top: 8pt;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_256/frag:3bae7fb76ee04b5bab5d57f0a0b5585f/table:3e5af201266341c09d8088746c7b2d6f"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 449.25pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 81.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 56.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 39.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 39.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 39.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 39.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 39.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 56.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 56.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 32.25pt;"><td class="cellStyle-d9963a49" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="2" colspan="1"><p class="Table-Normal-01828778" style="margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Table-Normal-d0b3ba93 C-Table-Normal">sin dato</span></p></td><td class="cellStyle-d9963a49