<span class="C-Header-page-number">103</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_277/frag:b3e1c0008de44fee93ffdc3387cd6ca7/table:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:header><div><div style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; vertical-align: top; width: 100%;"><p class="Heading-1" style="font-size: 17pt; margin-top: 0;"><span id="i67de2e1e9bd34f909147aeed68c14bef"></span><span class="C-Heading-1">1.&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;Evolución de los negocios</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">IBERDROLA es una sociedad </span><span class="C-Bodytext-e492cc84 C-Bodytext">holding;</span><span class="C-Bodytext"> en consecuencia, sus resultados provienen fundamentalmente de dividendos e ingresos devengados procedentes de la financiación concedida y los servicios prestados a sociedades participadas.</span></p><wk:section-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_277"></wk:section-end><wk:section-start hidden-section="false" name="2.	Hechos significativos del ejercicio" wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_280"></wk:section-start><div id="ib50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_280102" style="position: absolute; top: 0pt;"></div><p class="Heading-1" style="font-size: 17pt;"><span id="i694f7eaa4d7347daa01f1675aa97af03"></span><span class="C-Heading-1">2.&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;Hechos significativos del ejercicio </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_280/frag:760b3a4ae1d746e9834474aff0d8ead2/textregion:760b3a4ae1d746e9834474aff0d8ead2_44"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Heading-1">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_280/frag:760b3a4ae1d746e9834474aff0d8ead2/textregion:760b3a4ae1d746e9834474aff0d8ead2_44"></wk:observed-region-end></p><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">La operación más relevante del ejercicio ha sido la adquisición del 18,5% del capital que IBERDROLA todavía no poseía de AVANGRID. Tras la obtención de las autorizaciones necesarias, el 23 de diciembre de 2024 se ha consumado la operación, pasando IBERDROLA a ser titular del 100% del capital social de AVANGRID.</span></p><wk:section-start hidden-section="false" name="2.1	Principales magnitudes de la cuenta de resultados de IBERDROLA" wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283"></wk:section-start><div id="ib50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283102" style="position: absolute; top: 0pt;"></div><p class="Heading-2" style="font-size: 14pt;"><span id="ia196047bddde4a9a92588305cbda4e3b"></span><span class="C-Heading-2">2.1&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;&#xa0;Principales magnitudes de la cuenta de resultados de IBERDROLA</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">El importe neto de la cifra de negocios alcanza en </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_123"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_123"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> los </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_130"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="6794" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">6.794</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_130"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, de los que </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_163"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="6302" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">6.302</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_163"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros corresponden a dividendos recibidos de las empresas del grupo y asociadas, </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_259"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="23" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">23</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_259"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros a ingresos financieros por la financiación a filiales y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_336"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="469" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">469</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_336"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros a ingresos por servicios prestados a empresas del grupo.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">Las partidas de otros ingresos de explotación ascienden a </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_472"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="4" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">4</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_472"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, 2 millones más que el ejercicio anterior, al incorporar una indemnización de seguros por 2 millones de euros. Los gastos de explotación ascienden a </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_642"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="436" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">436</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_642"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, 59 millones de euros inferior al ejercicio </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_707"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_707"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="charStyle-2150276b">.</span><span class="C-Bodytext"> Los gastos de personal suponen </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_742"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="218" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">218</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_742"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros. Las amortizaciones alcanzan los </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_796"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="62" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">62</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_796"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros. El epígrafe de deterioros y enajenaciones de activos no corrientes es negativo por </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_901"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="15" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">15</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_901"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, por las correcciones valorativas de las inversiones, dotación de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_988"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="54" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">54</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_988"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros en Iberdrola Participaciones, S.A.U. y reversión de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1061"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="24" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">24</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1061"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros en Iberdrola Financiación, S.A.U. y </span><span class="C-Bodytext">de </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1121"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="1" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="15" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="true" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">15</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1121"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros en Scottishpower Overseas Holdings Ltd.</span><span class="C-Bodytext"> Todo ello lleva a un resultado de explotación del ejercicio de&#xa0; </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1246"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="6077" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">6.077</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1246"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">El resultado financiero ha sido negativo en </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1312"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="605" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">605</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1312"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros, principalmente por deudas con empresas del grupo y asociadas.</span></p><p class="Bodytext-07d736ca" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext">El beneficio antes de impuestos asciende a </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1439"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="5472" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">5.472</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1439"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros y el impuesto de sociedades supone un </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079