lass="Header-page-number" style="font-size: 8.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-page-number">| </span><span class="C-Header-page-number">104</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:b3e1c0008de44fee93ffdc3387cd6ca7/table:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:header><div><div style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; vertical-align: top; width: 100%;"><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Bodytext">Hemos de señalar los siguientes hechos que influyen de manera fundamental en los resultados del ejercicio:</span></p><p class="Bodytext-6ef513db" style="font-size: 11pt;"><span class="C-Bodytext-f9cba730 C-Bodytext">•</span><span class="C-Bodytext" style="padding-left: 14.15pt;">Las aportaciones de dividendos de las filiales en el ejercicio </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1830"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1830"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> han sido </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1842"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="473" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">473</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1842"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros superiores a los del ejercicio </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1894"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1894"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">, ascendiendo a </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1912"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="6302" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">6.302</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1912"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros frente a los </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1946"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="0" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="5829" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="true" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="4" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="true"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">5.829</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1946"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> millones de euros recibidos en </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1980"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_1980"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">.</span><span class="C-Bodytext"> El detalle de los dividendos recibidos de las empresas del grupo y asociadas se muestra en la Nota </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_2083"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" prefix="" raw-value="10" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">10</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/textregion:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f_2083"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext">. La variación de los dividendos recibidos de los </span><span class="C-Bodytext-e492cc84 C-Bodytext">subholdings</span><span class="C-Bodytext"> respecto del ejercicio anterior, expresada en millones de euros, es la siguiente:</span></p><div style="margin-bottom: 12pt; margin-top: 8pt;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_283/frag:2079333c5d83436a9f8d2af98516076f/table:593b12d6ce114f58b424b8aa658a7f48"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 432.75pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 219pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 71.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 71.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 71.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td></tr><tr style="height: 13.5pt;"><td class="cellStyle-d9963a49" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-left: 2.38pt; padding-right: 2.38pt; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><div style="height: 13.5pt; overflow: hidden;"><p class="Table-Norma