><span class="C-Header-Text">Iberdrola, S.A.</span></p></td><td class="cellStyle-ca0da46e" style="padding-bottom: 0; padding-top: 0;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"><p class="Header-page-number" style="font-size: 8.5pt; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Header-page-number">| </span><span class="C-Header-page-number">107</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><wk:table-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_298/frag:b3e1c0008de44fee93ffdc3387cd6ca7/table:20d7371a29704af7a980403896bbf53c"></wk:table-end></div></div></div></wk:header><div><div style="display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 0; margin-top: 0; vertical-align: top; width: 100%;"><p class="Bodytext" style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 0;"><span class="C-Bodytext">Los movimientos habidos durante los ejercicios </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_298/frag:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654/textregion:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654_2022"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2024" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2024</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_298/frag:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654/textregion:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654_2022"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> y </span><wk:observed-region-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_298/frag:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654/textregion:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654_2027"><wk:value-format currency-symbol="" decimal-separator="," delimiter-symbol="2" display-zero-as-type="0" format-string="" numbers-as-words="false" percent-symbol-visible="false" precision="0" prefix="" raw-value="2023" scale="0" show-positive-sign="false" show-thousands-separator="false" suffix="" symbol-placement="6" thousands-separator="." type="6" unit-format="0" unit-format-suffix="" use-absolute-value="false" use-dashes-for-zero="false" use-parens-for-negatives="false"></wk:value-format><wk:stream consumer="true" type="4"></wk:stream></wk:observed-region-start><span class="C-Bodytext">2023</span><wk:observed-region-end wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_298/frag:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654/textregion:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654_2027"></wk:observed-region-end><span class="C-Bodytext"> en las acciones propias en cartera de IBERDROLA han sido destinados, principalmente, a su amortización y a la aplicación de los sistemas retributivos de los empleados y han sido los siguientes:</span></p><div style="margin-top: 8pt;"><wk:table-start wuri="wurl://docs.v1/doc:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9/sec:b50e90b48ff148f8a7f19466ba68bda9_298/frag:49501685caff494a81fa2a0689a67654/table:677d9b0da6b149248c44954633cdd92f"></wk:table-start><table class="tableStyle-9810ea48" style="display: inline-table; vertical-align: text-bottom; width: 450.75pt;"><tbody><tr style="height: 0;"><td style="padding: 0; width: 110.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 69.75pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 50.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 50.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 50.25pt;" rowspan="1" colspan="1"></td><td style="padding: 0; width: 69.75pt;" rowspa